# Microservices Architecture - Root Tasks
# Copy to project root as .tasks
# Deploy to all services: run --across auth,api,worker,db deploy

# Build
0|Build|SUB|Build services
1|Build All|run --across auth,api,worker build --parallel|Build all services
1|Build Auth|run auth build|Build auth service
1|Build API|run api build|Build API service
1|Build Worker|run worker build|Build worker service
1|Back|BACK

# Testing
0|Testing|SUB|Test services
1|Test All|run --across auth,api,worker test --parallel|Test all services
1|Test Coverage|run --across auth,api,worker coverage --parallel|Coverage all
1|Back|BACK

# Deployment
0|Deployment|SUB|Deploy services
1|Deploy Dev|run --across auth,api,worker deploy:dev [depends: Build All]|Deploy to dev
1|Deploy Stage|run --across auth,api,worker deploy:staging [depends: Build All]|Deploy to staging
1|Deploy Prod|run --across auth,api,worker deploy:prod [depends: Build All,Test All]|Deploy to production
1|Back|BACK

# Status & Monitoring
0|Monitoring|SUB|Status & monitoring
1|Status All|run --across auth,api,worker status|Status all services
1|Logs All|run --across auth,api,worker logs|View all logs
1|Metrics|prometheus query up|Prometheus metrics
1|Back|BACK

# Database
0|Database|SUB|Database operations
1|DB Migrate|run db migrate|Run migrations
1|DB Backup|run db backup|Backup database
1|DB Seed|run db seed|Seed test data
1|Back|BACK

# Rollback
0|Rollback|SUB|Rollback deployments
1|Rollback Dev|run --across auth,api,worker rollback:dev|Rollback dev
1|Rollback Stage|run --across auth,api,worker rollback:staging|Rollback staging
1|Rollback Prod|run --across auth,api,worker rollback:prod|Rollback prod
1|Back|BACK

# Maintenance
0|Maintenance|SUB|Maintenance & health
1|Health Check|run --across auth,api,worker health|Check all services
1|Restart Services|run --across auth,api,worker restart|Restart services
1|Full Restart|run --across auth,api,worker restart && run --across auth,api,worker health [depends: Restart Services]|Full restart + health
1|Back|BACK

0|Exit|EXIT|Close menu
